# The gda daemon harness is generated tooling, committed VERBATIM (see AGENTS.md).
# It must stay byte-identical to what `gda daemon start` installs — hand-editing it
# to satisfy a whitespace linter (e.g. its trailing blank line) would make the next
# daemon start re-materialize it, breaking the idempotent no-op that committing it
# buys. So exempt it from whitespace checks (git diff --check / git apply) and mark
# it generated so it collapses in review diffs.
addons/gda_harness/** -whitespace linguist-generated
